WEBVTT

00:00:14.641 --> 00:00:16.511
Th-This is…

00:00:18.011 --> 00:00:20.271
Initiating docking procedures.

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:22.191
Roger.

00:00:33.991 --> 00:00:36.201
Elevating from 6 to 9 on the Torino Scale!

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:46.421
CITY A

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:46.421
HERO ASSOCIATION HQ

00:00:44.421 --> 00:00:46.421
It suddenly changed course?

00:00:47.711 --> 00:00:48.881
I see.

00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:52.221
Then we must now discuss
the best course of action.

00:00:53.721 --> 00:00:55.391
Should I go now?

00:00:56.051 --> 00:00:57.221
All right.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:02.231
Master, the Hero Association has summoned me for some reason.

00:01:02.231 --> 00:01:03.521
I will be back later.

00:01:04.061 --> 00:01:05.101
Okay.

00:01:05.101 --> 00:01:06.521
Maybe you're getting fired?

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:18.991
THE GREATEST APPRENTICE

00:01:28.331 --> 00:01:32.081
ONE PUNCH

00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:37.541
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:41.301
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:41.301
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:43.301
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:43.301
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:44.801
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:44.801
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:48.931
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:48.931
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:01:48.931 --> 00:01:52.561
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:01:48.931 --> 00:01:52.561
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:01:52.561 --> 00:01:56.401
POWER, GET POWER

00:01:56.401 --> 00:01:59.361
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:01:56.401 --> 00:01:59.361
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:01:59.361 --> 00:02:00.571
HERO

00:02:00.571 --> 00:02:03.741
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:02:00.571 --> 00:02:03.741
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:06.781
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:02:03.741 --> 00:02:06.781
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:02:06.781 --> 00:02:08.031
HERO

00:02:08.031 --> 00:02:12.791
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:02:08.031 --> 00:02:12.791
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:02:12.791 --> 00:02:14.251
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:02:14.251 --> 00:02:18.421
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:02:14.251 --> 00:02:18.421
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:02:18.421 --> 00:02:21.501
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:02:18.421 --> 00:02:21.501
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:02:21.501 --> 00:02:22.841
HERO

00:02:22.841 --> 00:02:27.841
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:02:22.841 --> 00:02:27.841
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:02:27.841 --> 00:02:35.061
A FIGHTING HERO

00:02:27.841 --> 00:02:35.061
TATAKAU HERO

00:02:35.061 --> 00:02:41.611
A SOLITARY HERO

00:02:35.061 --> 00:02:41.611
KODOKU NA HERO

00:02:41.611 --> 00:02:46.611
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:02:41.611 --> 00:02:46.611
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:02:49.041 --> 00:02:51.541
CITY Z

00:02:49.041 --> 00:02:51.541
HERO ASSOCIATION OFFICE

00:02:54.381 --> 00:02:57.051
Ah, you must be Genos?

00:02:58.091 --> 00:03:00.391
My name is Bang.

00:03:00.391 --> 00:03:01.801
Nice to meet you.

00:03:02.261 --> 00:03:05.891
Bang, Class S rank 3, a.k.a. "Silverfang."

00:03:06.391 --> 00:03:08.311
His skill is the real deal.

00:03:09.151 --> 00:03:11.651
The Association called me in.

00:03:11.651 --> 00:03:14.441
Everyone's at the headquarters.

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:17.151
This little branch office is empty right now.

00:03:17.151 --> 00:03:19.911
The call to assemble went out
to all S-class heroes,

00:03:19.911 --> 00:03:22.281
but we're the only ones who showed up.

00:03:22.701 --> 00:03:23.991
Why is that?

00:03:24.541 --> 00:03:28.161
Too far away, or perhaps they're busy.

00:03:28.871 --> 00:03:32.841
Some of the more cold-blooded
ones simply don't bother.

00:03:32.841 --> 00:03:34.881
After all, we're only called up

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:38.721
when there's some impossible problem they want us to handle.

00:03:39.551 --> 00:03:41.641
Today's no exception.

00:03:42.351 --> 00:03:46.391
The threat level is Dragon, a worst-case scenario.

00:03:46.771 --> 00:03:51.101
35 minutes from now,
a huge meteor will impact City Z.

00:03:51.101 --> 00:03:55.441
The call to arms was to see whether any nearby S-class heroes can do anything about it.

00:03:56.151 --> 00:03:57.531
A meteor?

00:03:57.531 --> 00:03:59.901
Apparently, it suddenly changed trajectory.

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:02.911
This is the end for us.

00:04:03.241 --> 00:04:05.581
The impact will wipe out City Z.

00:04:07.081 --> 00:04:09.791
I'm afraid there's nothing we can do this time.

00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:12.711
You should consider evacuating your loved ones as well.

00:04:13.331 --> 00:04:15.001
Do the citizens know?

00:04:15.551 --> 00:04:21.471
I was told they would estimate the impact area and issue evacuation orders 30 minutes before it hits.

00:04:23.391 --> 00:04:27.721
Attention! This is an announcement from the Hero Association.

00:04:29.021 --> 00:04:30.481
Panic is sure to ensue.

00:04:31.061 --> 00:04:32.521
And you, old man?

00:04:32.521 --> 00:04:33.731
"Old man," is it?

00:04:34.111 --> 00:04:36.151
Call me Bang.

00:04:36.151 --> 00:04:38.151
Are you not evacuating?

00:04:38.151 --> 00:04:40.951
My dojo has been in my family for generations.

00:04:40.951 --> 00:04:42.991
I cannot abandon it.

00:04:45.621 --> 00:04:47.791
"Rock-Crushing Fist of Flowing Water."

00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:48.871
Heard of it?

00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:52.671
He left…

00:04:55.881 --> 00:04:58.171
Emergency evacuation warning.

00:04:58.171 --> 00:05:00.421
Threat level: Dragon.

00:05:00.421 --> 00:05:03.261
Evacuate immediately.

00:05:03.261 --> 00:05:07.391
21 minutes until meteor impact.

00:05:07.391 --> 00:05:10.311
Experts predict total destruction of City Z.

00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:10.311
It's huge…

00:05:10.311 --> 00:05:12.481
No way we can escape that.

00:05:10.311 --> 00:05:15.271
Evacuate as quickly and as far as possible.

00:05:16.731 --> 00:05:21.031
So many people have given up hope of survival.

00:05:21.031 --> 00:05:22.821
It is not just City Z that is in danger.

00:05:23.071 --> 00:05:25.201
Neighboring cities will also be damaged.

00:05:26.071 --> 00:05:27.701
It is too late to evacuate.

00:05:29.991 --> 00:05:32.371
I did not expect to test this prototype so soon!

00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:55.941
Let me see if a blast from my incineration cannon at full power will do the trick.

00:05:56.651 --> 00:05:58.861
Master Saitama lives here too.

00:05:59.481 --> 00:06:01.481
I cannot possibly evacuate without him.

00:06:05.991 --> 00:06:06.571
Is that…?

00:06:19.041 --> 00:06:20.921
You are Bofoi, correct?

00:06:22.171 --> 00:06:24.171
And you are the new boy, Genos.

00:06:24.881 --> 00:06:27.091
Come to stop the meteor?

00:06:27.091 --> 00:06:27.761
Yes.

00:06:28.761 --> 00:06:29.601
Class S, rank 7.

00:06:30.351 --> 00:06:34.771
A hero who uses raw firepower to
obliterate his opponents and everything nearby.

00:06:34.771 --> 00:06:37.021
Does he also live in City Z?

00:06:37.021 --> 00:06:39.441
Or did he rush here, putting his life at risk?

00:06:40.151 --> 00:06:42.821
Bofoi, I need your help.

00:06:42.821 --> 00:06:43.941
I refuse.

00:06:43.941 --> 00:06:45.321
Why?

00:06:45.321 --> 00:06:49.371
I am only here to field test my new weapon.

00:06:49.371 --> 00:06:51.081
The meteor is a perfect target.

00:06:51.701 --> 00:06:53.041
A test?

00:06:53.041 --> 00:06:55.621
If that meteor hits, you too will die.

00:06:55.621 --> 00:06:56.911
I will not.

00:06:56.911 --> 00:06:57.371
What?

00:06:58.041 --> 00:07:02.381
You are currently talking to a
remotely controlled drone.

00:07:03.301 --> 00:07:06.261
Sorry to disappoint you,
but my life's not at stake here.

00:07:07.341 --> 00:07:11.181
Also, do not call me Bofoi.
I am Metal Knight.

00:07:11.181 --> 00:07:14.391
Heroes call each other by their hero names,
not their real names.

00:07:14.391 --> 00:07:15.851
Everyone knows that.

00:07:17.101 --> 00:07:20.861
Looks like it's time to end our little chat.

00:07:26.321 --> 00:07:27.111
All right!

00:07:28.821 --> 00:07:30.621
Launching missiles!

00:07:34.991 --> 00:07:36.001
Metal Knight?

00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:41.461
I cannot fire with his missiles in the way.

00:07:54.681 --> 00:07:56.141
Amazing.

00:07:56.141 --> 00:07:57.351
Such destructive power.

00:07:58.271 --> 00:07:59.641
This hero is dangerous.

00:07:59.641 --> 00:08:01.601
I must be wary.

00:08:11.571 --> 00:08:14.121
Not quite potent enough, eh?

00:08:16.041 --> 00:08:18.251
33 seconds until impact.

00:08:19.121 --> 00:08:21.331
To fire my incineration cannon at full power,

00:08:21.331 --> 00:08:23.251
it needs five seconds to charge.

00:08:24.291 --> 00:08:27.971
But the target is already bearing down on us.

00:08:27.971 --> 00:08:30.881
Not to mention, if I do take it out, what then?

00:08:30.881 --> 00:08:34.101
The meteor may break apart and still cause a disaster.

00:08:34.101 --> 00:08:37.181
But will my weapons even be powerful enough to stop it?

00:08:37.181 --> 00:08:40.351
Metal Knight's countless missiles had no effect.

00:08:41.481 --> 00:08:43.101
Calm yourself.

00:08:43.651 --> 00:08:45.901
I can tell you've lost your composure.

00:08:45.901 --> 00:08:50.611
You're far too young to be worried about failure.

00:08:50.611 --> 00:08:54.281
When your back's up against the wall,
just muddle through.

00:08:54.281 --> 00:08:55.741
The outcome won't change.

00:08:55.741 --> 00:08:57.831
So that's the best thing to do.

00:08:59.331 --> 00:09:01.251
Muddling through is best?

00:09:10.381 --> 00:09:10.921
He is right.

00:09:12.551 --> 00:09:15.051
If the outcome will not change,

00:09:17.301 --> 00:09:21.351
how can I die without giving it my all?

00:09:23.021 --> 00:09:24.601
Bang, get down!

00:09:25.351 --> 00:09:25.941
Oh.

00:09:26.611 --> 00:09:29.651
I will no longer think about failure or repercussions!

00:09:29.651 --> 00:09:32.281
I will just pour everything I have…

00:09:32.281 --> 00:09:33.491
into one last shot!

00:09:46.421 --> 00:09:47.591
Damn, no effect!

00:09:47.961 --> 00:09:51.421
No, I think I see the meteor being pushed back.

00:09:51.421 --> 00:09:52.971
Really?

00:09:52.971 --> 00:09:54.841
Oh, no. It was just my imagination.

00:09:54.841 --> 00:09:56.051
Stupid geezer!

00:09:59.181 --> 00:10:01.721
So this… will be my grave.

00:10:12.861 --> 00:10:14.571
Nine more seconds.

00:10:15.151 --> 00:10:17.321
Get out of here, Bang.

00:10:17.991 --> 00:10:20.371
Hey mister, take care of Genos.

00:10:26.371 --> 00:10:29.381
Wh-Who are you?

00:10:30.381 --> 00:10:32.881
I'm just your average hero.

00:10:45.431 --> 00:10:46.311
Master?!

00:10:49.231 --> 00:10:50.821
You're not…

00:10:52.821 --> 00:10:54.361
gonna fall on…

00:10:55.441 --> 00:10:56.071
my town!

00:11:08.251 --> 00:11:10.131
He shattered it!

00:11:10.131 --> 00:11:11.711
Unbelievable!

00:11:12.251 --> 00:11:12.881
But…

00:11:23.511 --> 00:11:24.511
It's collapsing!

00:11:25.771 --> 00:11:27.141
It's not just this building.

00:11:27.851 --> 00:11:31.731
The destruction is spreading throughout the whole city.

00:11:40.201 --> 00:11:41.741
Guess that settles that.

00:11:54.291 --> 00:11:56.811
THREE DAYS LATER

00:11:56.011 --> 00:12:00.681
Although City Z was able to avoid total destruction,

00:12:00.681 --> 00:12:07.101
the city was still devastated, with the effects of the meteor fragments visible everywhere.

00:12:05.931 --> 00:12:13.061
THREE DAYS SINCE ASTEROID IMPACT IN CITY Z

00:12:08.291 --> 00:12:13.061
If only the Hero Association had called you to help instead of me, Master.

00:12:13.691 --> 00:12:16.151
If you and Metal Knight worked together,

00:12:16.151 --> 00:12:18.571
the damage could have been minimized.

00:12:19.491 --> 00:12:23.111
But that Metal Knight guy wasn't interested in helping, right?

00:12:24.031 --> 00:12:25.881
So stop worrying about it.

00:12:25.881 --> 00:12:28.161
I think we kept the damage to a minimum.

00:12:28.161 --> 00:12:29.951
After all, no one died.

00:12:30.871 --> 00:12:32.161
He is right.

00:12:32.161 --> 00:12:35.711
Master's punch killed the meteor's momentum.

00:12:36.671 --> 00:12:41.211
Theoretically, the shockwaves from the meteor
would have annihilated everything.

00:12:41.881 --> 00:12:44.231
Stopping it was nothing short of a miracle.

00:12:44.231 --> 00:12:48.061
I would not be surprised if people
talk about Master for years to come,

00:12:48.061 --> 00:12:50.601
praising him as a courageous man.

00:12:50.601 --> 00:12:53.521
But Master has no idea.

00:12:53.521 --> 00:12:58.321
Some of the public is even
making him out to be the bad guy

00:12:58.321 --> 00:13:00.021
for causing the partial destruction of City Z.

00:13:01.571 --> 00:13:04.111
No, I should not mention it.

00:13:04.111 --> 00:13:05.031
By the way,

00:13:05.701 --> 00:13:08.581
do you think we moved up in the rankings?

00:13:08.581 --> 00:13:10.121
Yes, we did.

00:13:10.791 --> 00:13:13.541
I went from Class S rank 17 to 16.

00:13:13.541 --> 00:13:16.131
Metal Knight also moved up from rank 7 to 6.

00:13:16.751 --> 00:13:21.001
Master, you shot up in Class C,
from rank 342 to rank 5.

00:13:22.021 --> 00:13:23.381
Five?!

00:13:23.381 --> 00:13:26.181
From 342 to 5? What the hell?!

00:13:26.181 --> 00:13:27.971
That's crazy!

00:13:28.351 --> 00:13:29.391
Not at all.

00:13:29.391 --> 00:13:33.561
Your performance was worthy of Class A or even Class S.

00:13:33.561 --> 00:13:36.481
After all, it was a Dragon-level threat.

00:13:37.021 --> 00:13:37.941
Yeah?

00:13:37.941 --> 00:13:39.521
If there had been no damage,

00:13:39.521 --> 00:13:41.901
I am sure you would be ranked fifth in Class S.

00:13:43.491 --> 00:13:47.871
Smashing the meteor alone was worthy of Class A.

00:13:47.871 --> 00:13:51.161
But I think the Hero Association assumed that

00:13:51.161 --> 00:13:55.751
Metal Knight and I played a bigger role.

00:13:55.751 --> 00:14:00.381
By the way, they always report threat levels
as "demon" or "tiger" or whatever.

00:14:00.841 --> 00:14:02.131
Do they mean anything?

00:14:03.831 --> 00:14:04.631
They do.

00:14:04.671 --> 00:14:08.381
Tiger

00:14:05.091 --> 00:14:08.391
Tiger: A crisis threatening massive loss of life.

00:14:08.391 --> 00:14:13.391
Demon: A crisis threatening to halt the
functioning of an entire city, or to destroy it.

00:14:08.431 --> 00:14:13.391
Demon

00:14:13.431 --> 00:14:17.021
Dragon

00:14:13.811 --> 00:14:17.021
Dragon: A crisis threatening
to destroy multiple cities.

00:14:17.061 --> 00:14:20.021
God

00:14:17.391 --> 00:14:20.021
God: A crisis threatening human extinction.

00:14:20.021 --> 00:14:24.991
Tiger

00:14:20.021 --> 00:14:24.991
A crisis threatening massive loss of life.

00:14:20.021 --> 00:14:24.991
Demon

00:14:20.021 --> 00:14:24.991
A crisis threatening to halt the functioning
of an entire city, or to destroy it.

00:14:20.021 --> 00:14:24.991
A crisis threatening to destroy multiple cities.

00:14:20.021 --> 00:14:24.991
Heroes rush to your aid

00:14:20.021 --> 00:14:24.991
based on the threat level!

00:14:20.481 --> 00:14:22.981
Wow, I had no idea.

00:14:20.611 --> 00:14:24.991
Dragon

00:14:21.071 --> 00:14:24.991
A crisis threatening human extinction.

00:14:22.071 --> 00:14:24.991
God

00:14:22.981 --> 00:14:29.491
I believe heroes often consider threat levels
when deciding whether or not to respond.

00:14:23.981 --> 00:14:24.991
Q. When do heroes mobilize?

00:14:24.991 --> 00:14:28.861
Take shelter in some safe place.

00:14:24.991 --> 00:14:29.111
Don't panic, just escape

00:14:24.991 --> 00:14:29.351
If you see a monster

00:14:29.991 --> 00:14:32.411
But I guess they don't matter to you.

00:14:32.411 --> 00:14:33.871
Well, of course not.

00:14:34.751 --> 00:14:37.211
If the heroes run away, who's left to help?

00:14:40.831 --> 00:14:42.961
What are you doing?

00:14:42.961 --> 00:14:45.341
I must record your words.

00:14:46.511 --> 00:14:50.431
Anyway, it wasn't all that much for such a huge jump in rank…

00:14:51.181 --> 00:14:51.971
All right.

00:14:53.641 --> 00:14:55.851
I'll be out for a bit.

00:14:56.481 --> 00:14:58.231
You're going out, Master?

00:14:58.231 --> 00:14:59.691
I will come with you.

00:15:00.271 --> 00:15:01.521
You stay here.

00:15:01.521 --> 00:15:04.941
If something happens,
you'll get all the credit again.

00:15:12.031 --> 00:15:13.701
This place got hit hard…

00:15:17.541 --> 00:15:19.461
My favorite supermarket got smashed.

00:15:20.001 --> 00:15:23.341
And the crappy apartment building
I got kicked out of is…

00:15:23.341 --> 00:15:24.461
just fine. Damn.

00:15:26.091 --> 00:15:26.961
Hey.

00:15:28.551 --> 00:15:30.261
You cheating son of a bitch.

00:15:31.021 --> 00:15:33.261
Uh… who are you?

00:15:33.851 --> 00:15:36.521
You know damn well who I am!
I'm Tank-Top Tiger!

00:15:37.061 --> 00:15:38.771
Bro!

00:15:39.411 --> 00:15:40.771
It's that guy!

00:15:40.771 --> 00:15:43.111
Seriously, who is this guy?

00:15:44.631 --> 00:15:46.731
You called me, little bro?

00:15:47.901 --> 00:15:48.741
Bro!

00:15:48.741 --> 00:15:52.741
The hero Tank-Top Black Hole is here!

00:15:53.121 --> 00:15:54.321
So you're the fraud

00:15:54.321 --> 00:15:58.661
who takes credit for work done by
S-class heroes in order to jump the rankings?

00:15:58.661 --> 00:15:59.371
What the—?

00:16:00.081 --> 00:16:03.711
No one could move up to rank five
so quickly without cheating!

00:16:04.421 --> 00:16:05.131
Huh?

00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:07.211
What do you guys want?

00:16:07.501 --> 00:16:09.551
Huh? Isn't it obvious?

00:16:09.551 --> 00:16:11.841
To beat you up so bad you'll never be able to—

00:16:11.841 --> 00:16:13.301
Hang on, little bro.

00:16:14.391 --> 00:16:17.811
A beating isn't enough for bastards like him to get the message.

00:16:18.681 --> 00:16:21.391
Let's make him really pay…

00:16:21.391 --> 00:16:24.231
with the most brutal method there is.

00:16:25.861 --> 00:16:27.821
Are you the one?!

00:16:27.821 --> 00:16:31.281
The jackass responsible for destroying this city?!

00:16:33.611 --> 00:16:34.911
I see!

00:16:34.911 --> 00:16:38.121
There are tons of people in this city
who are angry with him.

00:16:38.541 --> 00:16:40.081
Unbelievable!

00:16:40.081 --> 00:16:41.871
How can you show your face?!

00:16:42.291 --> 00:16:43.581
I get it.

00:16:43.581 --> 00:16:45.831
He's going to use their anger…

00:16:45.831 --> 00:16:50.051
Do you feel nothing at the sight of this devastation?

00:16:50.961 --> 00:16:53.431
…to break his spirit!

00:16:53.431 --> 00:16:58.061
You're gloating, thinking you've actually saved these people!

00:16:58.061 --> 00:17:01.931
Why else would you be
walking around so shamelessly?

00:17:01.931 --> 00:17:03.441
Thanks to your screw-up,

00:17:03.441 --> 00:17:07.191
these citizens have nowhere to go!

00:17:07.611 --> 00:17:09.981
If you were gonna fail this hard,
why'd you butt in?!

00:17:09.981 --> 00:17:13.821
The other heroes would have done a way better job!

00:17:14.491 --> 00:17:18.461
And yet you still wanna play hero,
even after causing such a huge disaster?

00:17:18.461 --> 00:17:19.741
Look at this place!

00:17:19.741 --> 00:17:23.001
All this destruction is your fault!

00:17:25.251 --> 00:17:26.171
That's right.

00:17:27.041 --> 00:17:28.501
I-It's your fault!

00:17:30.131 --> 00:17:31.381
They took the bait!

00:17:32.301 --> 00:17:33.671
You hear that?

00:17:33.671 --> 00:17:36.681
The heart-wrenching cry of
someone who lost his home!

00:17:36.681 --> 00:17:42.601
Look at them all, victims of your thoughtless actions!

00:17:42.601 --> 00:17:43.641
That's right!

00:17:43.641 --> 00:17:44.941
Yeah, you tell him!

00:17:44.941 --> 00:17:47.831
Haven't you even thought to take responsibility?

00:17:47.831 --> 00:17:48.861
Yeah!

00:17:48.861 --> 00:17:50.441
You're inhuman!

00:17:50.441 --> 00:17:53.071
Give up being a hero!

00:17:53.071 --> 00:17:58.371
Give it up! Give it up! Give it up!

00:17:58.371 --> 00:17:59.281
Give it up!

00:17:59.621 --> 00:18:28.811
Give it up! Give it up! Give it up!

00:18:23.971 --> 00:18:25.181
We got him.

00:18:25.181 --> 00:18:28.191
His pride should be shattered by now.

00:18:28.191 --> 00:18:30.061
That's what he gets for cheating…

00:18:30.061 --> 00:18:31.151
That dumbass!

