00:19:07.481 --> 00:19:11.811
You're strong—the strongest I've ever met.

00:19:11.811 --> 00:19:14.611
That's why I'm not saying anything.

00:19:15.321 --> 00:19:19.531
I'd hate to see you rotting away in this industry.

00:19:19.531 --> 00:19:21.871
Resigning is also an option.

00:19:22.241 --> 00:19:24.621
Time to finish him off!

00:19:25.161 --> 00:19:25.831
Hey!

00:19:25.831 --> 00:19:27.751
He's getting ready to fight!

00:19:28.121 --> 00:19:29.001
Huh?

00:19:29.001 --> 00:19:29.621
What are you—

00:19:29.621 --> 00:19:30.791
No way!

00:19:30.791 --> 00:19:32.621
You're gonna take out your frustration

00:19:32.621 --> 00:19:36.421
on these people here,
just like how you destroyed their city?!

00:19:36.421 --> 00:19:38.261
Do you just kill everyone you don't like?

00:19:38.761 --> 00:19:40.431
Not on our watch!

00:19:40.431 --> 00:19:43.761
We, the Tank-Top Brothers,
will not stand by while you resort to violence!

00:19:44.551 --> 00:19:48.021
If you're a hero, then fight us fair and square!

00:19:48.931 --> 00:19:51.521
So they're out to crush a rookie

00:19:51.521 --> 00:19:54.691
and perform a publicity stunt at the same time.

00:19:54.691 --> 00:19:57.031
I'd say they've gotten a little greedy.

00:19:58.191 --> 00:20:00.781
No wonder they can't rise above Class B.

00:20:06.871 --> 00:20:10.291
Fighting like a true tiger, Tank-Top Tiger!

00:20:10.661 --> 00:20:15.541
Crushing all with a grip strength
of 2,800 psi, Tank-Top Black Hole!

00:20:15.961 --> 00:20:20.341
We brothers will punish all who stray from the path of the hero!

00:20:23.931 --> 00:20:24.471
Huh?

00:20:25.931 --> 00:20:27.181
Dammit!

00:20:27.181 --> 00:20:29.641
I'll rip you apart!

00:20:29.641 --> 00:20:33.151
O-Ouch!

00:20:33.151 --> 00:20:34.441
I give up! I give up!

00:20:34.441 --> 00:20:35.691
You're crushing my hand!

00:20:36.021 --> 00:20:36.611
Huh?

00:20:36.611 --> 00:20:38.651
You're kidding, right?

00:20:38.651 --> 00:20:41.741
I give up for real! I'm sorry!

00:20:41.741 --> 00:20:44.531
I'm sorry for lying!

00:20:44.531 --> 00:20:46.831
No, you weren't lying.

00:20:47.581 --> 00:20:50.081
I'm the one who smashed the meteor!

00:20:50.081 --> 00:20:51.711
If you have a complaint, let's hear it!

00:20:52.291 --> 00:20:53.331
Speak up!

00:20:56.041 --> 00:20:58.591
Because of you, my brand-new car was—

00:20:59.051 --> 00:21:00.711
You can shut up!

00:21:01.421 --> 00:21:03.631
Why would I give a crap about your problems?

00:21:03.631 --> 00:21:06.091
Tell it to the meteor, jackass!

00:21:06.601 --> 00:21:07.601
Listen up!

00:21:07.601 --> 00:21:11.811
I don't do this hero thing for admiration!

00:21:11.811 --> 00:21:13.731
I do it because I want to!

00:21:14.271 --> 00:21:16.021
So if you wanna blame me, go ahead!

00:21:16.021 --> 00:21:16.731
You baldies!

00:21:17.271 --> 00:21:18.271
You're the baldy…

00:21:18.771 --> 00:21:20.611
What was that?!

00:21:21.231 --> 00:21:22.611
Master.

00:21:22.611 --> 00:21:24.281
Oh, it's you, Genos.

00:21:24.911 --> 00:21:26.611
Hang on. These guys—

00:21:26.611 --> 00:21:27.871
Let's go home,

00:21:28.451 --> 00:21:29.281
Master.

00:21:34.461 --> 00:21:36.541
Oh. All right.

00:21:38.631 --> 00:21:39.711
Dammit.

00:21:39.711 --> 00:21:41.381
That guy's face is burned into my brain.

00:21:41.961 --> 00:21:43.471
I'm gonna remember this.

00:21:44.421 --> 00:21:45.631
Master.

00:21:46.301 --> 00:21:50.391
I have never met anyone as
incredible as you, Master Saitama.

00:21:51.471 --> 00:21:52.851
Where did that come from?

00:21:52.851 --> 00:21:53.891
You're creeping me out.

00:21:54.891 --> 00:21:56.901
Even if the public doesn't appreciate you,

00:21:57.901 --> 00:21:59.901
I will still follow you.

00:22:02.031 --> 00:22:03.651
